OL,3,GNEWSAMurder probe as man dies days
OL,4,Aafter assault
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo people have been arrested as part
OL,7,Fof a murder inquiry after a man died in
OL,8,Fhospital days after a reported assault
OL,9,Fin Leicester.
OL,11,FPolice said they were contacted on
OL,12,FWednesday by the family of a man who
OL,13,Fwas being treated for life-threatening
OL,14,Finjuries at the Queen's Medical Centre
OL,15,Fin Nottingham after he was found on
OL,16,FNarborough Road at about 06:30 BST on
OL,17,FMonday.
OL,19,FThe man, who was in his 20s, died from
OL,20,Fhis injuries on Thursday.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
