OL,3,GNEWSAMurder probe as man dies days
OL,4,Aafter assault
OL,5,
OL,6,FLeicestershire Police said a
OL,7,F31-year-old man and a woman, 39, have
OL,8,Fbeen arrested on suspicion of robbery
OL,9,Fand conspiracy to commit murder, and
OL,10,Fare currently in custody.
